        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/02/carplay-in-ios-26-added-new-setting-that-should-have-always-existed/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/06/carplay-ios-26-liquid-glass.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iOS 27 has <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/09/heres-everything-new-for-carplay-in-ios-27/\" type=\"post\" id=\"1055739\">exciting new features coming for CarPlay</a>, but nearly a year late, I recently tested out an iOS 26<em> </em>addition for CarPlay, and it’s one that should have existed all along.</p>",
