        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/02/apple-arcade-gets-four-new-games-including-pocket-city-2/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/07/apple-arcade.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Following last Tuesday’s addition of <a href=\"https://apple.co/4v3zpn2\">Family Feud Pocket</a>, <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/arcade/subscribe?itscg=30200&amp;itsct=arcade_box_subscribe\">Apple Arcade</a> is expanding its catalog once again today with four more games spanning city-building, dungeon crawling, fishing, and quick-draw challenges. Here are the details.</p>",
