        "title": "You’re paying for 80+ iPhone and iPad games through Netflix, here’s the full catalog",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/01/youre-paying-for-80-iphone-and-ipad-games-through-netflix-heres-the-full-catalog/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/07/netflix-games.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Looking for new iPhone and iPad games to play? The App Store has plenty of games without ads and in-app purchases.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple Arcade is a <a href=\"https://apple.co/35ZjKQy\">great subscription option</a> for families, though it’s not the only game in town. If you’re a Netflix subscriber, you’re also paying for a huge catalog of great iPhone and iPad games.</p>",
