        "url": "https://www.metafilter.com/213731/Pawboots-SLYT-2-Min-ad-Safe-for-Work-Just-video-and-background-music",
        "content_text": "<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ouY3T1Pp5xs\">This 2 minute ad for pawboots might make you smile</a> Anyone wishing to buy Pawboots can find them at <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&redir_token=QUFFLUhqbUdfT29vWnUxSERSejRka1RmejFUdXYzU2ZFUXxBQ3Jtc0tsYkVrMEI5eXl0dHhYRVZIem1sWENEV2FfVGI1Zzd4aUdzZGdjMm1udFoxZ2VPM201ZjFpOGd3VEsxT3YzQ3czVUZ5SjZESnM5aWtjeGVmRkVnTnVwcnpVdkFWM20wSjQ5dU13QjIxTUVPemtIM3FSQQ&q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.gentlefur.com%2Fproduct%2Fslim-paw-boots%2F&v=ouY3T1Pp5xs\">this link.</a>\n\nPlease note: I know nothing about this company other than that the ad made me smile.<br/><br/><em>\"Established in 2018, GentleFur is a brand that blends the desires of creatures from ancient times to the present, from both the East and the West. We are committed to crafting high-quality Furry cultural designs.\"</em> - Gentlefur.com About Pages\n\n2 songs featured in the video are:\n-  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JxAsxwqxZmA\">Limtless by Steve Beddall</a> \nand\n- <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2_3nhbkb2dA\">Run Wild By The Novembers</a>\n\nEnjoy.",
